---
title: Cache Architecture - Five Cost Control Tiers
---
flowchart TD
    Q["Incoming Question"] --> Intent["Intent Router Cache<br/>TTL 24h"]
    Q --> RAGCache["RAG Answer Cache<br/>TTL 1h"]
    Q --> SQLGen["SQL Generation Cache<br/>TTL 24h"]
    SQL["Normalized SELECT SQL"] --> SQLResult["SQL Result Cache<br/>TTL 15m"]
    Text["Text Chunk or Query Text"] --> Embedding["Embedding Cache<br/>TTL 7d"]

    Intent --> Redis[("Upstash Redis")]
    RAGCache --> Redis
    SQLGen --> Redis
    SQLResult --> Redis
    Embedding --> Redis

    Redis --> Fallback["In-Memory Fallback<br/>when Redis is not configured"]
    Redis --> Stats["/admin/cache/stats<br/>hits, misses, sets, hit rate"]
